    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0171" n="67" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg67"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2073a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Paraguay (Wheeler)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-08-15T18:00:00-04:00">August 15, 1932—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. Please discuss fully and frankly with President Ayala and his Government the Chaco situation and cable fully his
                    views regarding it and any suggestions they may have to make regarding a
                    settlement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
